WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.693
The sea in bloom.

00:02.393 --> 00:09.507
Green and yellow are water rich in plankton, plants too small to see that drift in the sunlit top of the sea.

00:09.957 --> 00:12.971
They bloom where currents bring food up from below.

00:13.421 --> 00:21.364
Between them they do about half of all the growing on the planet, and with the forests they breathe its carbon in and out every year.
